OL,3,GNEWSARoad remains closed following
OL,4,Abuilding collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA key route in a town centre remains
OL,7,Fclosed almost a week after two people
OL,8,Fwere injured when a building site
OL,9,Fpartially collapsed.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,Fapartment block, which was under
OL,13,Fconstruction and surrounded by
OL,14,Fscaffolding, on the A4260 Cherwell
OL,15,FStreet in Banbury, Oxfordshire, on 21
OL,16,FOctober.
OL,18,FThe Health and Safety Executive said on
OL,19,FTuesday it was investigating the
OL,20,Fincident, and its inspectors had
OL,21,Fvisited the site.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
