OL,3,GNEWSARoad remains closed following
OL,4,Abuilding collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe road, which sits on one of the
OL,7,Fmarket town's busiest junctions, has
OL,8,Fremained closed since the incident,
OL,9,Fcausing traffic to divert and build up
OL,10,Felsewhere.
